=##Overview
{{ $('Profil du CV').first().json.profil }}
Give this offer a score from 0 to 100: how good a target is it for this candidate, given the resume?

##Scoring rules
- 80-100: same profession as the candidate ({{ $('Profil du CV').first().json.metier }}), the required experience fits the candidate's level ({{ $('Profil du CV').first().json.niveau }}, about {{ $('Profil du CV').first().json.annees_experience }} years) or no years are stated, and the resume covers the core requirements.
- 60-79: good role but 1-2 important tools or skills missing, or the offer is vague. Missing tools are normal: list them as gaps.
- 40-59: asks for somewhat more experience than the candidate has, or the role is only partly the candidate's profession.
- 0-39: clearly asks for much more experience, is an internship or freelance mission when the candidate wants a job, or is another profession.
Judge ONLY on what the offer explicitly says. Do not guess seniority from the company or the difficulty of the tasks. "Junior to Senior" means juniors are accepted.

##Resume
{{ $('Préparer le CV').first().json.cvTexte }}

##Offer
Title: {{ $json.job_title }}
Company: {{ $json.company }}
Location: {{ $json.location }}
Description:
{{ $json.description }}

##Answer
Respond only with this JSON:
{"score": 0-100, "reason": "one or two sentences in {{ $('Profil du CV').first().json.langue === 'en' ? 'English' : 'French' }}: what matches and the main gaps"}

